{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And you shall dwell in the land securely.</b> For the sin of shemittah Israel goes into exile, as it says: ״אָז תִּרְצֶה הָאָרֶץ אֶת שַׁבְּתֹתֶיהָ, וְהִרְצָת אֶת שַׁבְּתֹתֶיהָ״ (Leviticus 26) — and the seventy years of the Babylonian exile correspond to the seventy shemittot that they nullified."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:08:17.678308885Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}